body:
{"narrative": "In early XXXX, US Bank instructed me to pay the taxes on my property to ensure I did not pay the taxes late and incur a late fee with Washington DC. While on the phone with US Bank ( on a recorded line ) I made the payment directly to the city. The representative on the phone from US Bank assured me on numerous occasions that US Bank would not send a duplicate payment to Washington XXXX DC and assured me that US Bank would cancel any pending payments to Washington DC. 

US Bank sent a duplicate payment on my behalf for {$2000.00} to Washington DC out of my escrow account. US Bank assured the payment would be returned to my account by XX/XX/XXXX -- 3 weeks after the US Bank servicing error. On XX/XX/XXXX they are now telling me they are unsure when the payment will be returned. 

I have since closed the loan and US Bank has not returned the money to me or my escrow account. US Bank has a servicing error that has resulted in significant financial harm to me as I am owed over {$2000.00}. US Bank has acknowledged their error, but has not provided a timely resolution."}

{"narrative": "On XX/XX/year>, I discovered I could not access my PayPal account due to an error stating my information was incorrect. I promptly reviewed my email and found a notification from PayPal dated XX/XX/year>, alerting me that an unauthorized email address ( XXXX ) had been added to my account, followed by an unauthorized transfer of {$390.00} to an unknown recipient, XXXX XXXX. Upon contacting PayPal Support, I was informed my account had been compromised on XX/XX/year>, with the attacker altering my password, security questions, email address, and adding two fraudulent phone numbers ( ending in XXXX and XXXX ). With the Help of PayPal support team, I was able to recover my Account, but I could not recover my funds. I have to pay my XXXX expenses. So please contact the PayPal team and review my Case ( Case ID : XXXX ) that I filed in PayPal and help me to get my funds back in my PayPal Account. 

My PayPal Account Details : To assist in your investigation, here is my account information : Name : XXXX XXXX XXXX Email : XXXX Original Phone Number : ( XXXX ) XXXX Last 4 Digits of SSN : XXXX Last 4 Digits of Linked Bank Account : XXXX Case ID : XXXX Please contact the PayPal Team and help me to get my Funds Back. Thank you for your urgent attention to this matter. 

Sincerely, XXXX XXXX XXXX."}

{"narrative": "XXXX was informed of billings to my credit card with XXXX from Google. Google has a ridiculous policy of only allowing 48 hours to request csncellatiom for a refund. How is this legal? All other credit card and service providers are a minimum of 30 days to allow for a cancellation. 

Second, XXXX never received from Google, from Google 's own website where I cancelled 4 months worth of XXXX XXXX and I cancelled this charge every month from the very beginning with Google! There are 4 charges of {$75.00} per month for XXXX  that was purchased through Google and canceled through Google. When is Google actually going to reply pond with canceling their billing for services no longer desired by their customers? I ask, as I am still being billed!

This is outright billing fraud!"}
